        "header": "Sector Scavenge — Candidate Intake",
        "body": "<p class=\"text-accent\">The written exam is over. Isolde Vane's voice still echoes across the grandstand as steam-lifts drop candidates into the Apex Ring arena basin.</p><p>Venture into your designated sector, secure raw scrap components, and claim tags for Squad 907 before nightfall!</p>",
