    {
      "id": "aggie_high_truth_node",
      "type": "custom",
      "position": { "x": 950, "y": -400 },
      "data": {
        "header": "Fungal Whispering — Truth Revealed",
        "body": "<p class=\"text-accent\">The glowing mycelium threads warm beneath your touch. A choir of tiny bio-luminescent moss sprouts reach toward your hands.</p>",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "<p>The roots rustle softly in a language only a Mizizi can understand:</p>"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "style": "quote",
            "content": "\"A big bark-skin treant named Bramble asked us to tell everyone that the tag was near the muddy sinkhole... but we like your mushroom cap better! Bramble is lying to candidates to keep the sector clear! The Prism-Lotus Tag is hidden right under the glowing shelf mushroom behind you!\""
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "<p>You realize Bramble (Squad 06) is running a disinformation campaign through the flora! You now have a choice in how to handle him:</p>"
          }
        ],
        "ports": [
          {
            "id": "port_aggie_flip_help",
            "text": "FLIP TO COOPERATION",
            "subtext": "Send a soft spore message back to Bramble proposing a peaceful loot share.",
            "scores": {
              "loot_prism_lotus_tag": 1,
              "loot_bioluminescent_algae": 1,
              "loot_spore_satchel": 1,
              "clue_bramble_alliance": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "port_aggie_counter_sabotage",
            "text": "COUNTER-ATTACK SABOTAGE",
            "subtext": "Instruct the plants to feed Bramble wrong coordinates while you gather everything clean.",
            "scores": {
              "loot_prism_lotus_tag": 1,
              "loot_bioluminescent_algae": 1,
              "loot_hydro_filter_reed": 1,
              "loot_prism_sponge": 1
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "aggie_mid_confused_node",
      "type": "custom",
      "position": { "x": 950, "y": -200 },
      "data": {
        "header": "Fungal Whispering — Mixed Signals",
        "body": "<p>The mycelium network twitches erratically. You pick up competing voices in the soil — one set pointing north toward glowing reeds, another pointing west toward a submerged lotus.</p>",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "<p>You sense someone else is active on this root frequency. You manage to filter out the noise and locate a prime stash of bio-flora supplies, though it takes extra time and careful scouting.</p>"
          }
        ],
        "ports": [
          {
            "id": "port_aggie_mid_claim",
            "text": "CLAIM BIO-FLORA STASH",
            "subtext": "Gather Bioluminescent Algae and Hydro-Filter Reeds.",
