    {
      "id": "aggie_low_false_node",
      "type": "custom",
      "position": { "x": 950, "y": 0 },
      "data": {
        "header": "Fungal Whispering — Misdirected Intel",
        "body": "<p class=\"text-red-400\">The plants confidently urge you forward:</p>",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "style": "quote",
            "content": "\"The tag is inside the dark hollow log! Hurry!\""
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "<p>You reach into the hollow log, only to be snapped at by thorny grasping vines! You pull back quickly, taking <strong>1 Stress</strong> from the jarring trap. As you brush off the spores, you realize the plants were fed false instructions by Bramble to mislead competing candidates.</p>"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "<p>You recover your bearings and scavenge what basic materials remain in the surrounding brush.</p>"
          }
        ],
        "ports": [
          {
            "id": "port_aggie_low_claim",
            "text": "RECOVER & GATHER REMNANTS",
            "subtext": "Secure basic Bioluminescent Algae and Hydro Reeds.",
            "scores": {
              "loot_bioluminescent_algae": 1,
              "loot_hydro_filter_reed": 1
            }
          }
        ]
      }
